{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mano.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "真乃 · 相遇 · first",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mano.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mano.first",
    "idolId": "mano",
    "startNodeId": "n01",
    "nodes": {
      "n01": {
        "id": "n01",
        "text": "公园的午后。长椅旁落着几只鸽子，一个女孩正低着头，小声哼着歌。",
        "nextNodeId": "n02"
      },
      "n02": {
        "id": "n02",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……ほわっ。",
        "nextNodeId": "n03"
      },
      "n03": {
        "id": "n03",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "啊、对不起。我没有注意到有人。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "刚才的歌，很好听",
            "nextNodeId": "n04a",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              },
              {
                "kind": "flag",
                "key": "mano_heard_song",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "你经常在这里唱歌吗？",
            "nextNodeId": "n04b"
          },
          {
            "label": "抱歉，打扰到你了",
            "nextNodeId": "n04c"
          }
        ]
      },
      "n04a": {
        "id": "n04a",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……真的吗？我只是随便哼的。",
        "nextNodeId": "n05"
      },
      "n04b": {
        "id": "n04b",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "嗯。这里很安静，鸽子也不会笑我。",
        "nextNodeId": "n05"
      },
      "n04c": {
        "id": "n04c",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "没有关系。是我自己在这里唱歌。",
        "nextNodeId": "n05"
      },
      "n05": {
        "id": "n05",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我叫樱木真乃。那个……你不是这附近的人吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n06": {
        "id": "n06",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "刚才的歌，其实是我自己想着写的。还没有给别人听过。",
        "nextNodeId": "n07"
      },
      "n07": {
        "id": "n07",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "制作人……？",
        "nextNodeId": "n08"
      },
      "n08": {
        "id": "n08",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "对不起。我还没有想过要成为偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "n09"
      },
      "n09": {
        "id": "n09",
        "text": "她低下头，手指轻轻攥住裙角。风把她的声音吹得很轻。"
      }
    }
  },
